# ==============================================================================
# .gitignore — Sistemas e Aplicações (SSA) / MEINF — UFP
# Churn & CLV in E-Commerce
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. R SESSION STATE AND CACHES
#    Regenerated on every session; never belongs in version control.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.Rhistory
.Rapp.history
.RData
.Ruserdata
*.RData
*.rds
*.Rda

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. PROJECT AND WORKSPACE FILES
#    NOTE: *.Rproj files are intentionally NOT ignored — they encode project
#    settings and are part of reproducibility. Only the per-user subfolder is
#    excluded, as it holds machine-local state that differs between users.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.Rproj.user/
*.Rproj.user/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. PACKAGE ENVIRONMENT
#    The lockfile IS tracked (it pins exact package versions for the grader).
#    Only the installed library cache is discarded.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
renv/library/
renv/staging/
renv/python/
renv/.python/
renv/cellar/
packrat/lib*/
node_modules/

# Lockfiles and manifests must stay tracked:
!renv.lock
!DESCRIPTION
!requirements.txt

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. RSTUDIO
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.RStudio/
# RStudio autosave / user settings
~$*.Rdata
~$*.Rhistory
.Renviron.user

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. DATA ARTIFACTS (REPRODUCIBLE, NOT VERSIONED)
#    The raw dataset is ~44 MB and is fully re-obtainable via
#    data/raw/download_data.R. Tracking it would bloat the repository without
#    adding information.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/raw/*
!data/raw/download_data.R
!data/raw/.gitkeep

# Processed/intermediate outputs — regenerated by the R pipeline
data/processed/*
!data/processed/.gitkeep

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 6. BUILD AND RENDERED OUTPUT
#    Quarto / R Markdown build products. Sources (*.qmd, *.Rmd) are tracked.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*_files/
*_cache/
.quarto/
_book/
_bookdown/
_site/
*.html
*.pdf.tmp

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 7. OPERATING SYSTEM AND EDITOR NOISE
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editor / IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 8. SECRETS AND LOCAL CONFIGURATION
#    Never commit credentials. API keys go in .env (gitignored) and are read
#    at runtime via Sys.getenv().
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.Renviron
!*.Renviron.example
secrets.yml
config.local.yml

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 9. MISCELLANEOUS
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp
.tmp_*
core
nohup.out

# Note: *.pdf deliverables in docs/ (m1.pdf, m2.pdf) ARE tracked intentionally —
# they are submitted assessment artifacts and are not excluded here.
